1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,000
She has grown a beautiful harvest.
Now she wants to sell it online.

2
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:08,000
The gift boxes are ready.
But reaching buyers is unfamiliar territory.

3
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:12,000
Where should she start?
She needs help taking product photos.

4
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:16,000
Nearby, a young resident has
a slow afternoon with nothing planned.

5
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:20,000
He has time and a camera.
He just has not found a local opportunity.

6
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:24,000
A paid photography task nearby
gives him a reason to get involved.

7
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:28,000
Village Jobs helps them connect
and arrange the work directly.

8
00:00:28,000 --> 00:00:32,400
A useful first step toward selling her harvest.
Here is how the connection works.

9
00:00:32,400 --> 00:00:34,900
One local task. One useful connection.

10
00:00:34,900 --> 00:00:37,400
English first. Korean available.

11
00:00:37,400 --> 00:00:40,400
Post a task without signing in.

12
00:00:40,400 --> 00:00:43,400
Text first. Voice is optional.

13
00:00:43,400 --> 00:00:47,900
Meta Muse Spark extracts the task conditions.

14
00:00:47,900 --> 00:00:52,400
Place, time, pay and people needed.

15
00:00:52,400 --> 00:00:56,400
The farmer stays in control.

16
00:00:56,400 --> 00:01:00,400
Edit the pay and description, then review.

17
00:01:00,400 --> 00:01:02,400
Review, then publish.

18
00:01:02,400 --> 00:01:04,400
Edit or close it from the same browser.

19
00:01:04,400 --> 00:01:07,400
Search by town and open the details.

20
00:01:07,400 --> 00:01:10,400
See the place, time and pay before signing in.

21
00:01:10,400 --> 00:01:15,400
Verify before applying.
Local test code only; no email sent.

22
00:01:15,400 --> 00:01:19,400
Add a name, note and contact.

23
00:01:19,400 --> 00:01:23,400
Explicit consent is required to share it.

24
00:01:23,400 --> 00:01:27,400
The farmer sees the shared contact in My jobs.

25
00:01:27,400 --> 00:01:31,400
They arrange the work and payment directly.

26
00:01:31,400 --> 00:01:34,900
Withdrawal hides the shared contact.

27
00:01:34,900 --> 00:01:38,400
Already-seen information cannot be taken back.

28
00:01:38,400 --> 00:01:42,900
Memory-only data resets on server restart.

29
00:01:42,900 --> 00:01:47,400
Real-user validation and retention impact
remain unproven.

30
00:01:47,400 --> 00:01:52,400
Village Jobs.
A local opportunity starts with a conversation.

